1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,880
MENDAKI is introducing

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:01,620
the Ready for School

3
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,160
e-voucher initiative

4
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,400
which we hope to help kids

5
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,140
from Primary One

6
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:07,460
all the way up to university.

7
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,800
So, as we begin the school year

8
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,120
as you know, for many parents

9
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:10,920
it's also a time where

10
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,460
there are a lot of

11
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,320
expenses for school

12
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,120
and we want our kids

13
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,980
to have the best start in life.

14
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:15,540
You have things like

15
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,300
schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms

16
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,220
and other expenses

17
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,080
that parents have to fork out.

18
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,020
And during these times

19
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,760
especially when you have

20
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,740
cost of living concerns

21
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,560
challenging times

22
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,560
we want to help parents

23
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,300
from low-income families

24
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,000
to support their kids.

25
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,040
This year, MENDAKI

26
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,640
is giving out $250 e-vouchers

27
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,260
that parents can use

28
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:32,440
for their children

29
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,080
whether it's schoolbooks

30
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,160
whether it is stationery

31
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,640
or even shoes.

32
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,680
We are pegging it at about

33
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,000
$1,000 per capita income

34
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,680
and below.

35
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,880
So we expect more than

36
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,360
22,000 students

37
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,860
who could benefit from this.

38
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:44,800
So it's an application basis

39
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:45,560
and we start to take

40
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,320
applications from 1st December.

41
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,320
So we hope that this

42
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,600
will do its part

43
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,540
to help parents and children

44
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,200
have a good start for the year

45
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,200
and not to worry

46
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,380
about some of these expenses

47
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,300
that would have otherwise

48
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,980
held them back.
